  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Information Centre to Support the Integration of Migrants in Slovakia (Phase X)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Migration Information Center (MIC) is to facilitate the effective integration of third country nationals in the Slovak Republic. The integration services provided by the MIC target employment and language learning, but also address broader issues of social inclusion, community cohesion, respect for human rights and political participation.</narrative>
  </description>
